    "title": "古今学识",
    "category": 5,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">· 古今学识</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"185\" alt=\"4-1.png\" title=\"4-1.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20250610/3d2acf5691c0f440cc89757a78c0407a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过探险获取分数，转换为</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">，可用于升级</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">古今学识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的各项能力。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;常规行动&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">模式中，每累计获得200得分，将获得1点</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">点数，</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">点数可用于点亮加成节点。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">古今学识中</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《筑经》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《启工记》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《设园通鉴》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点无需消耗</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">失落智识</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">即可解锁，不会影响后续的古今学识节点。这三个节点效果将分别在</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">请君入园</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的等级到达3、6、9及以上时生效。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"> *能力对所有模式都生效，</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《筑经》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《启工记》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">《设园通鉴》</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">只对</span><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">&lt;常规行动&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">模式生效。</span></span></p>",
    "displayTime": "2025-07-14",
